'''Braithwaite Hall''' is a 17th-century [[manor house]] in [[Coverdale (dale)|Coverdale]] in the [[Yorkshire Dales]] in England.  It lies {{convert|1.8|mi}} west of the village of [[East Witton]].  It is a [[Grade II* listed building]],<ref>{{NHLE |num=1318557 |accessdate=10 April 2016}}</ref> owned by the [[National Trust]].
